{"path":"/services/conversion-rate-optimization/","slug":"services__conversion-rate-optimization","kind":"service","title":"Conversion Rate Optimization Agency for B2B | Legency Media","description":"A B2B conversion rate optimization agency. The traffic you already pay for turned into more qualified pipeline: research, testing and landing page work run as one programme, each change reported by what it did.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Conversion Rate Optimization Agency for B2B</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every point of conversion is money you already spent bringing the visit in. Conversion rate optimization finds where the site loses that visit, usually before the form, changes it on evidence, and follows the result through to qualified pipeline. Every change is recorded with what it did, so the same idea never gets paid for twice.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Evidence Before Opinion</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why Conversion Stays Flat While Traffic Grows</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Pages change because someone senior prefers them</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Pages change because someone senior prefers the new version. Nobody can say afterwards whether it helped, so the site becomes a record of who was in the room rather than what worked.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Leads are up and the conversion slide is flat</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Traffic has grown for two quarters and conversion has not moved. That is the board slide nobody wants to present: plenty of activity, and no change in the number that pays for it.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Nobody checks whether the leads became pipeline</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Conversion gets measured at the form and stops there. Nobody checks whether the extra leads became pipeline, so a change that doubled junk enquiries still reads as a success.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The first fix lands on the page costing the most</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Analytics, session behaviour and the sales team point at where the site loses people. The backlog is ranked by the size of the leak, so the first test is on the page that costs the most.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Tests are sized to the traffic you actually have</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where the traffic supports a test we run one and wait for significance. Where it does not, we say so and change the page on research instead, then track the before and after honestly.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M16 13C13.2386 13 11 11.8807 11 10.5C11 9.11929 13.2386 8 16 8C18.7614 8 21 9.11929 21 10.5C21 11.8807 18.7614 13 16 13Z\"/><path d=\"M11 14.5C11 15.8807 13.2386 17 16 17C18.7614 17 21 15.8807 21 14.5\"/><path d=\"M3 9.5C3 10.8807 5.23858 12 8 12C9.12583 12 10.1647 11.814 11.0005 11.5\"/><path d=\"M3 13C3 14.3807 5.23858 15.5 8 15.5C9.12561 15.5 10.1643 15.314 11 15.0002\"/><path d=\"M3 5.5V16.5C3 17.8807 5.23858 19 8 19C9.12563 19 10.1643 18.8139 11 18.5\"/><path d=\"M13 8.5V5.5\"/><path d=\"M11 10.5V18.5C11 19.8807 13.2386 21 16 21C18.7614 21 21 19.8807 21 18.5V10.5\"/><path d=\"M8 8C5.23858 8 3 6.88071 3 5.5C3 4.11929 5.23858 3 8 3C10.7614 3 13 4.11929 13 5.5C13 6.88071 10.7614 8 8 8Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A result you can put in front of a board</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Conversions are tracked through to qualified opportunities wherever your CRM allows it, so each change is reported as pipeline rather than form fills. A change that lifts submits and drops qualified leads is a loss, and it gets reported as one.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The Programme</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What the Programme Puts in Your Hands</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Ranked List of Where Money Leaks</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A full pass over the paths that matter: landing pages, the pricing page, the forms, the mobile experience and the speed budget. It ends in a ranked list of leaks with the traffic and the value behind each one.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Test Queue That Keeps Moving</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Hypotheses drawn from the audit, run in order of expected value. Each test states what it expects to move before it starts. Wins ship, losses get documented, and the log is yours to keep.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Campaign Pages Ready Inside the Window</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Pages built as components in Webflow, so a new campaign page takes hours rather than a sprint and is live while the campaign still runs. Built to be tested: the parts most likely to change are the easiest to swap.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Conversions Followed Past the Form</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Events, goals and CRM handoff wired so a conversion can be followed to a qualified opportunity. Without this the whole programme is guesswork dressed as data.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section mde\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"container mde__grid\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"mde__text\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Before Anyone Sells You Testing</span><h2 class=\"mde__heading\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Most B2B Sites Lack the Traffic to Run a Test</h2><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>An A/B test can only prove a change bigger than the noise in your own traffic. That threshold is arithmetic, and it is the first thing we work out, because a test called early ships the wrong page.</p><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>On a 2% conversion rate, a site with a thousand visits a month can only prove a change that more than doubles conversion. Nobody makes that change on purpose. A site with fifty thousand can prove an 18% lift, which is a realistic target.</p><p class=\"mde__note\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Where the traffic is not there, we say so and change the page on research instead, then track the before and after honestly rather than calling it a test.</p></div><div class=\"mde__viz\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><figure class=\"bars\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__list\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>1,000 a month</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:95.38461538461539%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>+124%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>5,000 a month</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:42.30769230769231%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>+55%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>20,000 a month</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:21.53846153846154%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>+28%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row bars__row--hi\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>50,000 a month</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:13.846153846153847%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>+18%</span></div></div><figcaption class=\"bars__source\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>Smallest lift a one-month test could prove, at 95% confidence and 80% power, on a 2% baseline with traffic split evenly across two variants. Computed, not illustrative. Bars are the size of change required, so shorter is better.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"section leaks\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"leaks__head\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Where B2B Sites Lose People</span><h2 class=\"leaks__heading\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The Five Leaks We Find Most</h2><p class=\"leaks__sub\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>These come up on nearly every audit. None of them is a design argument, and all of them are measurable before and after.</p></div><ol class=\"leaks__list\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><li class=\"leaks__item\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"leaks__num\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>01</span><div data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><h3 data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The form asks for things sales never uses</h3><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Company size, job title, phone number, \"how did you hear about us\". Each field costs completions. We check which of them the sales team has ever filtered on, and the ones nobody uses come off. This is usually the largest recoverable loss on a B2B site, and it costs nothing to fix.</p></div></li><li class=\"leaks__item\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"leaks__num\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>02</span><div data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><h3 data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The page speaks to one person on a committee</h3><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>B2B buying runs through several people who are not the champion. The page answers the practitioner and says nothing to the person who has to sign, so the champion has nothing to forward. Pricing posture, security posture and implementation effort are the ones usually missing.</p></div></li><li class=\"leaks__item\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"leaks__num\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>03</span><div data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><h3 data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Mobile is treated as a smaller desktop</h3><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>A third of B2B traffic reads on a phone even where nobody buys on one. Blueflame's mobile score went from 36 to 72 in a day, and that was a build problem rather than a design one.</p></div></li><li class=\"leaks__item\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"leaks__num\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>04</span><div data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><h3 data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The proof is generic</h3><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Four logos and a testimonial with no number in it. Proof has to be specific enough to be checkable, or the reader discounts all of it including the true parts.</p></div></li><li class=\"leaks__item\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"leaks__num\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>05</span><div data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><h3 data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Nothing is tracked past the form</h3><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Conversion is counted at submit and never followed. So a change that lifts form fills and fills the pipeline with junk reads as a win in every report, and the sales team quietly stops trusting marketing's numbers.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"section testlog\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"container testlog__grid\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"testlog__text\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The Deliverable</span><h2 class=\"testlog__heading\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The Test Log Is Yours to Keep</h2><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Every test is written down before it runs: the page, the hypothesis, what it expects to move, and how long it needs. Afterwards it gets a result, including the ones that lost.</p><p data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The losses are the part that makes the log worth keeping. An agency that only records its wins hands the next agency a blank page, and your company pays to learn the same thing twice.</p><p class=\"mde__note\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>The log is yours. It stays useful after we are gone, and it is the record of what your own audience responds to.</p></div><div class=\"testlog__card\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><div class=\"testlog__row testlog__row--head\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Test</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Expected</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Result</span></div><div class=\"testlog__row\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Cut form from 9 fields to 4</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>+20% submits</span><span class=\"testlog__win\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Shipped</span></div><div class=\"testlog__row\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Pricing posture above the fold</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>+10% demo starts</span><span class=\"testlog__win\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Shipped</span></div><div class=\"testlog__row\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Video hero on the home page</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>+15% engagement</span><span class=\"testlog__loss\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>No effect</span></div><div class=\"testlog__row\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Social proof bar under the CTA</span><span data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>+8% submits</span><span class=\"testlog__loss\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Reverted</span></div><p class=\"testlog__note\" data-astro-cid-kn3eqkos>Shape of the log, not a client's results. Real test logs stay with the client.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Paid search and landing pages tuned together for eighteen months.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>We manage Blueflame&#39;s paid search and the pages those clicks land on, and have for over eighteen months. Campaign and landing page get tuned together, against the same conversion data, and organic search now brings more demo requests than paid.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Leaks</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out Where the Site Loses People</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A call about your traffic and your forms, because those two decide whether testing is even possible. If the volume is not there yet we will say so, and tell you what is worth doing instead.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What your traffic can and cannot prove, before anything is promised</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The leaks we find most often, and which ones apply to you</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Conversions tracked past the form wherever your CRM allows it</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/services/conversion-measurement/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we measure and report it</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What does a conversion rate optimization agency actually do?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It finds where a site loses people, using analytics, session recordings and the sales team rather than opinion. It tests changes against that evidence. Then it reports what each change did to pipeline, including the ones that failed. Anything that skips the first step is a redesign.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How much traffic do we need before CRO is worth it?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>For testing specifically, more than most people are told. On a 2% conversion rate, a month of traffic split across two variants needs roughly 20,000 visits before a test can prove a 28% lift, and around 50,000 before it can prove an 18% one. At 1,000 visits a month the only change a test could prove is one that more than doubles conversion, which is not a change anyone makes deliberately. Below the threshold, CRO is still worth doing: the audit, the form work and the page rebuilds all pay, and we track them as before-and-after rather than pretending a test ran.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How long before conversion work shows a result?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The audit produces fixable problems in the first fortnight, and the obvious ones ship straight away. A test needs two to six weeks to conclude depending on traffic. Compounding gains take a few months, because they come from a run of small wins rather than one redesign, and each one is on the monthly report the month it lands.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you redesign the whole site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Only when the audit says the structure is the problem. A redesign resets everything you have learned and makes the result impossible to attribute, so it is the expensive answer. Most of the value sits in a handful of pages, and we would rather prove that first.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Is CRO different from landing page optimization?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Landing page optimization is one part of it, and usually the part with the fastest return because campaign traffic is concentrated and high intent. CRO covers the whole path, including the pages someone visits after the landing page and before they convert.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What do you need from our team?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Analytics access, CRM access if you want conversions tracked to pipeline, and about an hour a month. The reason we ask for sales input is that the sales team already knows which leads are junk, and that is the fastest route to the right test.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".bars__list[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{gap:14px;display:grid}.bars__row[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{align-items:center;gap:var(--sp-2);grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,.9fr) minmax(0,3fr) max-content;display:grid}.bars__label[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{font-size:var(--para-sm);align-items:center;gap:.6em;line-height:1.2;display:flex}.bars__logo[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{flex:none;width:20px;height:20px}.bars__track[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{background:#201d1d17;border-radius:100px;height:14px;overflow:hidden}.bars--on-dark[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq] .bars__track[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{background:#ffffff24}.bars__fill[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{background:#201d1d73;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;height:100%}.bars--on-dark[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq] .bars__fill[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{background:#ffffff73}.bars__row--hi[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq] .bars__fill[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq]{background:var(--blue)}.bars--on-dark[data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq] .bars__row--